# This repo is the public GitHub profile: everything under assets/ ships.
# The fonts are a build-time input for harness/text2path.py, never a runtime
# asset -- the banners contain outlined <path> data, so nothing here is served.
# Keeping ~10 MB of binaries out of a profile repo, and out of every clone.
#
# Re-fetch with the URLs recorded in docs/fonts.md.
*
!.gitignore
